.if \n[.g] .mso www.tmac
.TH SDL_GPUSwapchainComposition 3type "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 DATATYPES"
.SH NAME
SDL_GPUSwapchainComposition \- Specifies the texture format and colorspace of the swapchain textures.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_gpu.h>
.PP
.BI "typedef enum SDL_GPUSwapchainComposition
.BI "{
.BI "    SDL_GPU_SWAPCHAINCOMPOSITION_SDR,
.BI "    SDL_GPU_SWAPCHAINCOMPOSITION_SDR_LINEAR,
.BI "    SDL_GPU_SWAPCHAINCOMPOSITION_HDR_EXTENDED_LINEAR,
.BI "    SDL_GPU_SWAPCHAINCOMPOSITION_HDR10_ST2084
.BI "} SDL_GPUSwapchainComposition;
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
SDR will always be supported\[char46] Other compositions may not be supported on certain systems\[char46]
.PP
It is recommended to query
.BR SDL_WindowSupportsGPUSwapchainComposition
after claiming the window if you wish to change the swapchain composition from SDR\[char46]
.PP

\(bu SDR: B8G8R8A8 or R8G8B8A8 swapchain\[char46] Pixel values are in sRGB encoding\[char46]
.PP
\(bu SDR_LINEAR: B8G8R8A8_SRGB or R8G8B8A8_SRGB swapchain\[char46] Pixel values are stored in memory in sRGB encoding but accessed in shaders in \(dqlinear sRGB\(dq encoding which is sRGB but with a linear transfer function\[char46]
.PP
\(bu HDR_EXTENDED_LINEAR: R16G16B16A16_FLOAT swapchain\[char46] Pixel values are in extended linear sRGB encoding and permits values outside of the [0, 1] range\[char46]
.PP
\(bu HDR10_ST2084: A2R10G10B10 or A2B10G10R10 swapchain\[char46] Pixel values are in BT\[char46]2020 ST2084 (PQ) encoding\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This enum is available since SDL 3\[char46]2\[char46]0\[char46]

.SH SEE ALSO
.BR SDL_SetGPUSwapchainParameters (3),
.BR SDL_WindowSupportsGPUSwapchainComposition (3),
.BR SDL_WaitAndAcquireGPUSwapchainTexture (3)
